<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GST Telecomms rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GST Telecomms rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon Reed &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of GST Telecommunications Inc with a buy rating, citing strong fundamentals, accelerating momentum and compelling valuation.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 1/8 at 11-1/8.</p>
</text>
